# Backend Python

- Python 3.11+, Pydantic v2, explicit type annotations on all public functions.
- Providers and repositories are `Protocol` (or ABC) classes; adapters implement them.
- `VisionProvider.identify_meal` is async and returns `NormalizedFoodPrediction`.
- Claude vision uses tool-calling / structured tool input, not free-form JSON in assistant text.
- Supabase implementations live in `backend/repositories/`; do not query Postgres from `api/`.
